Set up your Internet connection, configure wireless, configure USB port, etc.

Releases up to 22.03.2 are missing the module kmod-usb-dwc2 to make USB functional. 
See issue https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/issues/11326. 
Install kmod-usb-dwc2 manually to make USB functional.

